Title: Marry Me by Friday
Episode: 1 - The Hundred-Dollar Bill
Format: Live-action, cinematic vertical micro drama, 9:16, about 85 seconds
Draft date: 2026-10-19

INT. HALCYON TOWER - CEO OFFICE - DAY

[[HOOK: a hundred-dollar bill lands on the wet marble beside Mia's yellow gloves.]]

A hundred-dollar bill flutters down and lands on wet marble, beside two yellow rubber gloves.

MIA CALLOWAY (26, grey cleaner's uniform, yellow gloves, a small scar through one eyebrow) kneels by her mop bucket. She looks up.

DAMIEN BLAKE (35, charcoal three-piece suit, grey eyes) stands over her and flicks a second bill after the first.

DAMIEN
Clean it. Then get out.

MIA (V.O.)
Five years. He never once learned my name.

A step behind Damien, CHLOE PRICE (29, white dress, platinum bob) holds up her red phone, filming.

CHLOE
Smile, you're on camera.

She hooks the bucket with her heel. Dirty water spreads across the marble, over the bills.

CHLOE (CONT'D)
(giggling)
Oops.

DAMIEN
Take her badge.

Chloe yanks the staff badge off Mia's uniform and dangles it.

[[TWIST: the will has been read, and only the viewer sees it.]]

Mia's phone buzzes in her apron. She reads it. The screen's glow is on her face, and her face goes very still.

ON SCREEN: "Whitlock: The will was read. It's yours. All 51%."

MIA (V.O.)
He's standing on my floor.

Mia stands. She picks up the wet bill, looks Damien in the eye, and tears it in half.

DAMIEN
Pick that up.

MIA
Clean it yourself.

Chloe's laugh dies.

DAMIEN
(cold)
Do you know who I am?

MIA
Do you know who I am, Mr. Blake?

DAMIEN
The help.

CHLOE
(laughing)
The *former* help.

She raises her coffee cup in a toast.

[[PAYOFF: Mia takes back her badge and drops it in Chloe's coffee.]]

Mia plucks her badge out of Chloe's fingers and drops it into Chloe's coffee. Plop.

MIA
Keep it. I won't need it.

The room freezes.

[[CLIFFHANGER - arrival: the family lawyer bursts in and names her the majority owner.]]

The office doors swing open. ARTHUR WHITLOCK (67, navy suit, burgundy bow tie, gold half-moon glasses) steps in, out of breath, a brass-cornered briefcase in his hand.

WHITLOCK
Miss Calloway.

Damien and Chloe turn to the door.

WHITLOCK (CONT'D)
The board is waiting for its majority owner.

CLOSE ON DAMIEN

His face goes white.

CUT TO BLACK.
